# Mask System Power Settings Via Systemctl | T1653 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_systemctl_mask_power_settings.yml
Image="*/systemctl" CommandLine="* mask*" (CommandLine IN ("*suspend.target*", "*hibernate.target*", "*hybrid-sleep.target*"))
